d="00:47.111" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:43.154" end="00:43.394">The</span> <span begin="00:43.394" end="00:43.616">e</span><span begin="00:43.616" end="00:44.128">lec</span><span begin="00:44.128" end="00:44.331">tric</span> <span begin="00:44.331" end="00:44.490">pi</span><span begin="00:44.490" end="00:44.622">a</span><span begin="00:44.622" end="00:44.875">no</span> <span begin="00:44.875" end="00:45.292">whis</span><span begin="00:45.292" end="00:45.781">pers</span> <span begin="00:45.781" end="00:46.265">to</span> <span begin="00:46.265" end="00:46.522">the</span> <span begin="00:46.522" end="00:47.111">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">电钢琴在夜色中轻声细语</span></p><p begin="00:47.244" end="00:50.856" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:47.244" end="00:47.478">While</span> <span begin="00:47.478" end="00:47.733">we're</span> <span begin="00:47.733" end="00:47.984">ba</span><span begin="00:47.984" end="00:48.236">thing</span> <span begin="00:48.236" end="00:48.452">in</span> <span begin="00:48.452" end="00:48.700">the</span> <span begin="00:48.700" end="00:49.203">soft</span> <span begin="00:49.203" end="00:49.649">and</span> <span begin="00:49.649" end="00:50.148">sil</span><span begin="00:50.148" end="00:50.385">ver</span> <span begin="00:50.385" end="00:50.856">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当我们沉醉于那柔和如银的月光里</span></p><p begin="00:51.380" end="00:55.001" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:51.380" end="00:51.886">No</span> <span begin="00:51.886" end="00:52.082">more</span> <span begin="00:52.082" end="00:52.309">noise</span> <span begin="00:52.309" end="00:52.557">and</span> <span begin="00:52.557" end="00:53.036">no</span> <span begin="00:53.036" end="00:53.532">more</span> <span begin="00:53.532" end="00:53.786">ci</span><span begin="00:53.786" end="00:54.288">ty</span> <span begin="00:54.288" end="00:55.001">heat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">再无喧嚣，也无城市的燥热烦扰</span></p><p begin="00:55.001" end="01:01.063" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:55.001" end="00:55.241">Just</span> <span begin="00:55.241" end="00:55.491">the</span> <span begin="00:55.491" end="00:56.071">sound</span> <span begin="00:56.071" end="00:56.240">of</span> <span begin="00:56.240" end="00:56.903">two</span> <span begin="00:56.903" end="00:57.671">heart</span><span begin="00:57.671" end="00:57.922">s</span> <span begin="00:58.876" end="00:59.097">in</span> <span begin="00:59.097" end="00:59.301">a</span> <span begin="00:59.301" end="00:59.577">stea</span><span begin="00:59.577" end="00:59.862">dy</span> <span begin="00:59.862" end="01:01.063">beat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">唯有两颗心，在平稳的律动中紧紧相依</span></p><p begin="01:02.755" end="01:06.378" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:02.755" end="01:02.987">And</span> <span begin="01:02.987" end="01:03.235">the</span> <span begin="01:03.235" end="01:03.461">syn</span><span begin="01:03.461" end="01:03.701">the</span><span begin="01:03.701" end="01:03.946">si</span><span begin="01:03.946" end="01:04.189">zers</span> <span begin="01:04.189" end="01:04.686">float</span> <span begin="01:04.686" end="01:04.919">like</span> <span begin="01:04.919" end="01:05.156">a</span> <span begin="01:05.156" end="01:05.393">gen</span><span begin="01:05.393" end="01:05.868">tle</span> <span begin="01:05.868" end="01:06.378">mist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">合成器的音符如轻柔薄雾般漂浮流淌</span></p><p begin="01:06.378" end="01:10.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:06.378" end="01:06.588">In</span> <span begin="01:06.588" end="01:06.828">a</span> <span begin="01:06.828" end="01:07.338">mo</span><span begin="01:07.338" end="01:07.568">ment</span> <span begin="01:07.568" end="01:07.816">that</span> <span begin="01:07.816" end="01:08.058">was</span> <span begin="01:08.058" end="01:08.521">wai</span><span begin="01:08.521" end="01:09.014">ting</spa