pan ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哦，就让这旋律带我们远走高飞吧</span></p><p begin="01:21.839" end="01:25.704" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:21.839" end="01:22.087">Be</span><span begin="01:22.087" end="01:22.329">yond</span> <span begin="01:22.329" end="01:22.569">the</span> <span begin="01:22.569" end="01:22.800">e</span><span begin="01:22.800" end="01:23.573">choes</span> <span begin="01:23.573" end="01:23.981">of</span> <span begin="01:23.981" end="01:24.256">the</span> <span begin="01:24.256" end="01:24.766">bu</span><span begin="01:24.766" end="01:25.211">sy</span> <span begin="01:25.211" end="01:25.704">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">飞越白日里那些纷乱嘈杂的回响</span></p><p begin="01:25.946" end="01:33.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:25.946" end="01:26.193">With</span> <span begin="01:26.193" end="01:26.430">a</span> <span begin="01:26.430" end="01:27.155">90s</span> <span begin="01:27.155" end="01:27.615">soul</span> <span begin="01:27.615" end="01:28.376">so</span> <span begin="01:28.376" end="01:28.842">mel</span><span begin="01:28.842" end="01:29.088">low</span> <span begin="01:29.088" end="01:29.570">and</span> <span begin="01:29.570" end="01:30.055">so</span> <span begin="01:30.055" end="01:33.260">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">带着九十年代灵魂那份醇厚与真挚</span></p><p begin="01:33.460" end="01:38.339" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:33.460" end="01:34.170">I'm</span> <span begin="01:34.170" end="01:34.645">fin</span><span begin="01:34.645" end="01:34.902">ding</span> <span begin="01:34.902" end="01:35.416">e</span><span begin="01:35.416" end="01:35.843">very</span> <span begin="01:35.843" end="01:36.651">peace</span> <span begin="01:36.651" end="01:36.853">of</span> <span begin="01:36.853" end="01:37.336">mind</span> <span begin="01:37.336" end="01:37.849">in</span> <span begin="01:37.849" end="01:38.339">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在你怀中，寻得了内心所有的安宁</span></p><p begin="01:57.132" end="02:00.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:57.132" end="01:57.430">The</span> <span begin="01:57.430" end="01:57.687">a</span><span begin="01:57.687" end="01:57.897">na</span><span begin="01:57.897" end="01:58.360">log</span> <span begin="01:58.360" end="01:58.846">warmth</span> <span begin="01:58.846" end="01:59.100">is</span> <span begin="01:59.100" end="01:59.341">a</span> <span begin="01:59.341" end="01:59.572">blan</span><span begin="01:59.572" end="01:59.825">ket</span> <span begin="01:59.825" end="02:00.074">for</span> <span begin="02:00.074" end="02:00.312">the</span> <span begin="02:00.312" end="02:00.799">soul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">模拟信号的暖意，是包裹灵魂的绒毯</span></p><p begin="02:01.039" end="02:04.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="02:01.039" end="02:01.521">Ma</span><span begin="02:01.521" end="02:01.769">king</span> <span begin="02:01.769" end="02:02.003">e</span><span begin="02:02.003" end="02:02.261">very</span> <span begin="02:02.261" end="02:02.489">bro</span><span begin="02:02.489" end="02:02.709">ken</span> <span begin="02:02.709" end="02:02.949">part</span> <span begin="02:02.949" end="02:03.181">of</span> <span begin="02:03.181" end="02:03.453">me</span> <span begin="02:03.453" end="02:03.942">feel</span> <span begin="02:03.942" end="02:04.686">whole</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">抚平我每一处破碎，让我重获完整</span></p><p begin="02:04.686" end="02:09.565" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:04.686" end="02:05.145">No</span> <span begin="02:05.145" end="02:05.643">strings</span> <span begin="02:05.643" end="02:05.896">to</span> <span begin="02:05.896" end="02:06.347">pull</span> <span begin="02:06.347" end="02:06.835">just</span> <span begin="02:06.835" end="02:07.063">a</span> <span begin="02:07.063" end="02:07.330">har</span><span begin="02:07.330" end="02:07.565">mo</span><span begin="02:07.565" end="02:08.056">ny</span> <sp